FEXCore + vixl patch (MaxPS4 mission 61): time-slice preemption for an
embedder running several guest threads on one host thread. Apply after the
other patches/fexcore-*.patch and patches/vixl-*.patch files.
- FEXCore::MaxPS4::PreemptRequest checked at the dispatcher loop top: jumps to
  the thread stop handler (static registers spilled, State.rip current).
- Simulator builds: a registry of compiled block entries (host -> guest RIP)
  lets vixl stop at the next block entry while a request is pending, so
  linked loops are interrupted without disabling block linking.
- FEXCore::MaxPS4::BlockLinking=false (optional) routes every exit through
  the dispatcher instead (also usable on native ARM64).

